OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny mist quickly clearing to
OL,6,Fleave a mostly dry day. Sunny spells
OL,7,Fare likely, mainly through this
OL,8,Fmorning but cloud will generally build
OL,9,Fand a few light showers are possible
OL,10,Fprimarily in the west. Becoming windy
OL,11,Fin the northwest.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FStaying mostly dry this
OL,14,Fevening and overnight, but spots of
OL,15,Frain and drizzle are possible at
OL,16,Ftimes. Gales are possible in the far
OL,17,Fnorthwest and rather blustery
OL,18,Felsewhere. Very mild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
