OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FLargely cloudy and rather
OL,6,Fwindy with rain edging into the far
OL,7,Fnorthwest by lunchtime and continuing
OL,8,Fslowly southeast through the
OL,9,Fafternoon. Very mild and feeling
OL,10,Funseasonably warm in any brightness.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRain on
OL,13,FThursday night, then breezy and colder
OL,14,Fon Friday with sunny spells and
OL,15,Fpossible showers. Settled and largely
OL,16,Fdry thereafter with some sunshine and
OL,17,Fcold, locally frosty nights.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
